# The Moogle's Picnic! (otherAreas 101): the edges of the check and the trade. Give a Moogle a Break accepted: its own
# reply; then available (its own sections off) at fame level 5 (GMs): this quest off: the menu; then completed (a GM):
# on. A Bastok char in Bastok Mines' Mog House (zmrg). GetSystemTime() is the harness's 1800000000 throughout (no step
# but `wait jst=` moves it). Fame 324 (level 4): the menu; 325 (level 5): 30009 (finished with option 0: questSeen 1;
# out and back clears it). The local mustZone 1 (a GM, as the bed's placing sets it): the menu. bedPlacedTime 0: the
# menu; now - 60 (not >): the menu; now - 61: 30009. Accepted (a GM): the lure alone; the lure, the butter and a
# feather: nil (tradeMatches is exact): the script's trade (nothing). Prog 2, then -1 (GMs): nil: the menu. Prog 1,
# Timer now (a GM): not < now: nil; Timer now - 1: 30012, finished: completed.
lists BastokMines/Moogle/onTrigger BastokMines/Moogle/onTrade BastokMines/onEventFinish/30009 BastokMines/onEventFinish/30012
char zone=BastokMines pos=116.9,-1.6,-72 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
setting ENABLE_AMK 0                    # AMK 1 (30023, the Moogle, ENABLE_AMK 1) off: #kinds shows it
quest OtherAreas.GiveAMoogleABreak accepted
fame Bastok 324
charvar Quest[4][101]bedPlacedTime 1799999939
item ShrimpLure
item StickOfSelbinaButter
item ChocoboFeather
login
zoneline BastokMines                    # into the Mog House
trigger Moogle                          # Give a Moogle a Break not completed (accepted): its own reply; this quest off
finish-if-event
quest OtherAreas.GiveAMoogleABreak available # a GM: Give a Moogle a Break not completed (its own sections off)
fame Bastok 325                         # a GM: level 5
trigger Moogle                          # Give a Moogle a Break not completed: this quest off: the menu
fame Bastok 324                         # a GM: level 4 again
quest OtherAreas.GiveAMoogleABreak completed # a GM
trigger Moogle                          # fame level 4: the menu
fame Bastok 325                         # a GM: level 5
trigger Moogle                          # 30009
finish option=0                         # questSeen 1
warp -6,0,-50 BastokMarkets             # out: questSeen cleared
warp 116.9,-1.6,-72 BastokMines
zoneline BastokMines
localvar Quest[4][101]mustZone 1        # a GM (the bed's placing sets it)
trigger Moogle                          # the local mustZone 1: the menu
localvar Quest[4][101]mustZone 0        # a GM
charvar Quest[4][101]bedPlacedTime 0    # a GM
trigger Moogle                          # no bed: the menu
charvar Quest[4][101]bedPlacedTime 1799999940 # a GM: now - 60
trigger Moogle                          # not > bedPlacedTime + 60: the menu
charvar Quest[4][101]bedPlacedTime 1799999939 # a GM: now - 61
trigger Moogle                          # 30009
finish option=0
quest OtherAreas.TheMooglePicnic accepted # a GM
warp -6,0,-50 BastokMarkets
warp 116.9,-1.6,-72 BastokMines
zoneline BastokMines
trade Moogle ShrimpLure x1                # the lure alone: nil; the script's trade
trade Moogle ShrimpLure x1 StickOfSelbinaButter x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # with a feather: nil (exact)
charvar Quest[4][101]Prog 2             # a GM
trigger Moogle                          # Prog 2: nil; the menu
charvar Quest[4][101]Prog -1            # a GM
trigger Moogle                          # Prog -1: nil; the menu
charvar Quest[4][101]Prog 1             # a GM
charvar Quest[4][101]Timer 1800000000   # a GM: now
trigger Moogle                          # Timer not < now: nil; the menu
charvar Quest[4][101]Timer 1799999999   # a GM: now - 1
trigger Moogle                          # 30012
finish                                  # completed; the safes + 10
